# Avro contracts

Two families, checked separately:

- `contracts/avro/` — `hvac_telemetry_v1.avsc`, `hvac_telemetry_v2.avsc`
- `contracts/plant/` — `plant_snapshot_v1.avsc`

```powershell
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe contracts\check_compatibility.py contracts\avro
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe contracts\check_compatibility.py contracts\plant
```

CI job `schema-compat` runs both. New fields are nullable with a default.
`check_compatibility.py` enforces backward compatibility against every retained
version. Do not change or remove an existing field.
